  "body": "Brand-New Coastal Living. Blue-Chip Position. Clear Vendor Intent.\r\n\r\nTHE MOVE\r\nTakutai Avenue carries weight, and this brand-new freestanding home makes the address even harder to ignore.\r\nSet in one of Half Moon Bay's most prestigious coastal pockets, the lifestyle is immediate: marina, cafes, restaurants, supermarket, coastal walkways and ferry access to the CBD and Waiheke Island, all moments from home.\r\n\r\nInside, open-plan living flows to a generous outdoor deck, creating an easy setting for entertaining, family living and relaxed coastal evenings. Upstairs, three double bedrooms plus a versatile single bedroom or rumpus give the home flexibility, while the master suite adds the privacy of a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n\r\nModern, polished and practical, this is low-maintenance coastal living with real presence.\r\n\r\nTHE REALPLAY\r\nBrand-new. Freestanding. Premium fittings. Internal garage. Quality appliances. Strong school zoning for Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nIn a blue-chip street where position matters, this is a smart move for buyers who understand lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are committed. The opportunity is clear.",
